  "title": "Herbed Shrimp Scampi in a Pouch",
  "description": "Fire up the grill to cook foil packets of herb-seasoned, buttery shrimp. Serve with some good crusty bread for dipping in the juices.",
  "authors": [
    "It's A New Day"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T03:04:00-04:00",
